<header><p class="enc-kicker">Religion / idea · period</p><h1 class="enc-title">Age of Enlightenment</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Enlightenment</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Age of Enlightenment was an intellectual movement of the seventeenth and eighteenth centuries that emphasised reason, science, individual rights and reform of government. It shaped political thought across <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/europe">Europe</a> and beyond. In the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/polish-lithuanian-commonwealth">Polish-Lithuanian Commonwealth</a>, Enlightenment ideas influenced reformers and culminated in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/constitution-of-3-may-1791">Constitution of 3 May 1791</a>.</p></div>
